ownload button appears only when a ",[299,346,347],{},"download"," function is passed, and it is called only when the button is pressed, so there is no need to fetch the file up front and put it in ",[299,350,351],{},"v-model","; the page decides on auth headers, POST and the like. Return a ",[299,354,355],{},"Blob"," to have the component save it under ",[299,358,343],{},", or return nothing if the page handled the download itself (for example by opening a new tab). While downloading, the button shows a spinner and ignores repeated clicks; throwing an error shows the download failed toast (requires ",[299,361,362],{},"UApp","), and the passed ",[299,365,366],{},"signal"," is aborted on unmount. With a local ",[299,369,182],{},", the local file is downloaded directly and ",[299,372,347],{}," is not called.",[296,375,376,377,381],{},"When the file name is truncated, hovering or keyboard focus shows the full name, or a long press on touch devices (see ",[378,379,217],"a",{"href":380},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the file dialog.",[328,383],{"name":384},"file-existing",[309,386,388],{"id":387},"clearing","Clearing",[296,390,391,394,395,397,398,400,401,403,404,400,406,409,410,413,414,416],{},[299,392,393],{},"clear"," is on by default and shows a trailing clear button when there is a local ",[299,396,182],{}," or an existing attachment; it is hidden while disabled or loading. Clearing sets ",[299,399,351],{}," to ",[299,402,321],{}," and ",[299,405,343],{},[299,407,408],{},"''",", leaving the field completely empty so a new file can be selected. Bind the attachment name with ",[299,411,412],{},"v-model:file-name"," so the page can tell from ",[299,415,408],{}," that the user removed the existing attachment; when it is passed one-way, clearing still empties the field.",[296,418,419,420,423,424,427,428,431,432,436,437,441],{},"Pass ",[299,421,422],{},":clear=\"false\""," to disallow removal; it is off by defau